# UI/UX skill guidance

When editing Dealwire frontend surfaces, follow the project skills in `.cursor/skills/`:

1. **frontend-design** — distinctive visual direction; preserve the teal ops aesthetic already established
2. **effective-ui-design** — WCAG 2.1 AA, 8pt spacing, fluid type, form/button hierarchy, reduced motion
3. **ui-design-brain** — component best practices and anti-patterns
4. **web-design-guidelines** — audit against Vercel Web Interface Guidelines when reviewing UI

Preserve the Dealwire brand: wordmark **Dealwire**, tagline **Leads in. Deals out.**, Syne + Space Grotesk, teal accent on deep navy, warm amber for Sales. Prefer refining hierarchy, accessibility, and interaction quality over redesigning from scratch.
